title: The Military
view-if: bruning_plot == "successful" and paramilitaries_timer == 0
frequency: 100
new-page: true
is-card: true
card-image: img/d_rose.jpg
tags: agitation


= The Military

We can use, or establish connections in the military.

On the other hand we could further sabotage their efforts in a variety of ways.

- @militarize22: Start a scheme to siphon military equipment into the Reichsbanner.
- @militarize44: Start a scheme to siphon even more military equipment into the Reichsbanner.
- @militarize66: Start a scheme to siphon experimental, highly classified military equipment into the Reichsbanner.
- @spread_socialism: We can spread socialism among the lower ranks of the military.
- @sabotage: We can sabotage the military.
- @propaganda: We can spread propaganda, highlighting the brutality of the military.
- @return: Perhaps another time.
- @easy_discard

@spread_socialism
subtitle: We will use our spies to do this. -1 resource.
choose-if: resources > 0
on-arrival: left_sympathies += 0.05 if spy_network < 6; left_sympathies += 0.1 if spy_network >=6; resources -= 1

[? if spy_network < 6 : We spread propaganda among on lower ranks of the military, but it does not seem to be effective. ?]

[? if spy_network >= 6 : Using our pervasive spy network, we can spread our propaganda thoroughly. ?]


@sabotage
subtitle: Simple sabotage, -1 resource.
choose-if: resources > 0
on-arrival: resources -= 1; reichswehr_militancy -= 0.1

We have successfully sabotaged the reichswehr.

@militarize22
view-if: militarization_left_progression == 1
subtitle: Should be an operation, but i feel like it would be too hard. Anyways, [? if left_sympathies < 0.33 : The military is not sympathetic to our cause. ?]
choose-if: left_sympathies > 0.21
on-arrival: rb_militancy += 0.5; rfb_militancy += 0.25; militarization_left_progression = 2

Using our connections in the military we now have an array of military grade equipment.

@militarize44
view-if: militarization_left_progression == 2
subtitle: Should be an operation, but i feel like it would be too hard. Anyways, [? if left_sympathies < 0.33 : The military is not sympathetic to our cause. ?]
choose-if: left_sympathies > 0.43
on-arrival: rb_militancy += 1; rfb_militancy += 0.5; militarization_left_progression = 3

Using our connections in the military we now have an even further amount of military grade equipment.

@militarize66
view-if: militarization_left_progression == 3
subtitle: [? if spy_network < 9 : -2 resources ?] [? if spy_network >= 9 : 0 resources, we have sufficiently built up our spy network to be self reliant. ?], [? if left_sympathies < 0.33 : The military is not sympathetic to our cause. ?]
choose-if: left_sympathies >= 0.65
on-arrival: tank_plot +=10; plot_target = "tank"; spy_network +=3 if spy_network < 9; plot_strength = spy_network; resources -=2 if spy_network < 9; assassination_partners = "Spies"; resources +=1; month_actions +=1; paramilitaries_timer = 2; {!
new_hire()
!}

Using our connections in the military we now have an array of military grade equipment.

@propaganda
subtitle: This will increase their reluctance. 1 resource. [? if violence_perceived_left > violence_perceived_republic : The public views us as the main aggressor. ?]
choose-if: violence_perceived_republic > violence_perceived_left
on-arrival: military_reluctance += 20; military_reluctance = 100 if military_reluctance > 100; resources -= 1

We have successfully spread propaganda, and now the military is less willing to use, harsher methods.